# ruler-a-30 (h5-ruler): a's box held 30 px into a drag.
# The ruler floats 4 px under a's row with the scale tape centred near 1.06;
# the URL is unchanged until release flushes it.
# X is the shared box centre at 1440x900 (probe).
# Y is the overlap band shared with the port: the port sits 18 px higher until h5-buttons lands the readout height (see progress).
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 331.5 441.5
down
move 336.5 441.5 over 40
move 341.5 441.5 over 40
move 346.5 441.5 over 40
move 351.5 441.5 over 40
move 356.5 441.5 over 40
move 361.5 441.5 over 40
shot ruler-a-30
up
wait 1200
